# Titan 2 Elite hardware keyboard: searching the full emoji picker with the hardware keys. The search
# opens from the picker's search button or from the search key (A) of the paged SYM emoji page and
# takes the keys from the first one, even though the editor lays out again when the picker opens.
# A result picked while "Keep the emoji picker open after typing an emoji" is on (the default) keeps
# the search, Enter types the top result and closes the picker, and the next opening shows the
# emoji grid again instead of the old results.
# Needs the setting on, the SYM page "Emoji picker" enabled after the default pages (device, emoji,
# symbols; SYM four times opens it), 🚀 as the top result for "rocket" and 😀 visible when the
# picker opens (recents or the first page).
require profile titan2elite_qwerty
require layout qwerty
preserve keyboard mode
hw type ok
hw press AGUI_SYM
hw press AGUI_SYM
hw press AGUI_SYM
hw press AGUI_SYM
wait 800
screen press picker:search
wait 500
hw type rocket
wait 800
screen press emoji:🚀
wait 300
expect Ok🚀
hw press ENTER
expect Ok🚀🚀
hw type " a"
expect "Ok🚀🚀 a"
hw press AGUI_SYM
hw press AGUI_SYM
hw press AGUI_SYM
hw press AGUI_SYM
wait 800
screen press emoji:😀
expect "Ok🚀🚀 a😀"
hw press AGUI_SYM
hw press AGUI_SYM
hw press AGUI_SYM
wait 500
hw press P
wait 300
hw press A
wait 800
hw type rocket
wait 800
hw press ENTER
hw type b
expect "Ok🚀🚀 a😀🚀b"
